>Anyone know why I have sooo much trouble wishing for +3 anything? or 3 of
>anything??  Speaking of wishes, I'm about to wish for holy water!  I've not
>found any yet, and I'm getting desparate.

Don't do it. Drop potions of water on a coaligned altar, then pray
while standing on the altar. If your god is pleased, he/she'll turn
the water into holy water.

You can get potions of water by dipping any potion in a fountain or
moat, or by dipping a unicorn horn in a potion of hallucination,
sickness, or confusion.



